            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nWe recommend studying the previous texts in this chapter. We also suggest reading the text on the multiplication tables of 6 and 7: it introduces the concepts that we build on in this material.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "b5efc8f9-c268-430f-9681-7a43848ee48e",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
